<title>JAPAN: Go Iron Works -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Go Iron Works -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	   FORECAST	  YEAR-AGO</p>
<p> Sales		  4.18		 4.10		 4.03</p>
<p> Current	     22    million	  92    million	 116    million</p>
<p> Net		   14    million	  38    million	  45    million</p>
<p>NOTE - Go Iron Works Co Ltd is a stone crushing and sorting machinery maker.</p>
